  "description": "Web crawler for .NET 10 that downloads a complete website and produces three combinable outputs: JSON (extracted information), Markdown snapshot (AI/LLM-ready, with RAG corpus, llms.txt and imported teaser pages) and a raw file archive (html, js, css, images, fonts, pdf, docx, csv...) with locally rewritten links. Licensed under the Caveman License (MIT + mandatory attribution to Passaro Francesco Paolo - Digitalsolutions.it).",
