  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0: first public release. Three combinable outputs (Json / Markdown / Files), 20 browser identities + 40 Accept-Language profiles, session warm-up with token/cookie replay, CSS-recursive asset discovery (fonts, sprites, CDN), Markdown snapshot with imported teaser pages, RAG corpus (chunks/pages/corpus/manifest), llms.txt, raw archive with locally rewritten links and de-minified js/css.",
